<title>USA: Streamlogic names Scherer CFO.</title>
<headline>Streamlogic names Scherer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp Tuesday named Barbara Scherer as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Scherer will also continue as senior vice president, operations.</p>
<p>Scherer replaces outgoing Chief Financial Officer Lee Hilbert, who has resigned to take a position with a local company rather than move to Northern California as part of StreamLogic's planned consolidation, it said.</p>
<p>StreamLogic develops and markets video delivery systems, digital media storage, and other products.</p>
</text>
